{"id":"5759593987eeba93","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Tree Sum","display":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum — ZFC Tree10 Tree Sum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum — ZFC Tree10 Tree Sum","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum — ZFC Tree10 Tree Sum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathcal T,R,i,j,s,t\\in V\">\\(S,\\mathcal T,R,i,j,s,t\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\)</span> (tree-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d25b709595952a78\" href=\"?note=d25b709595952a78\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md\">../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S(S,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\times\\mathcal T(i)\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nS=\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\land t\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\}\n\\land\\exists R\\;\\bigl(R=\\{\\langle\\langle i,s\\rangle,\\langle j,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid i=j\\land s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S(S,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\times\\mathcal T(i)\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\nS=\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\land t\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\}\n\\land\\exists R\\;\\bigl(R=\\{\\langle\\langle i,s\\rangle,\\langle j,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid i=j\\land s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is the tagged disjoint-union carrier of a set-indexed family of trees. Its componentwise order is now an explicit set witness in the assertion, rather than a prose-only abbreviation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md","status":"resolved","id":"d25b709595952a78","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S$ (tree-order predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-zfc-tree8-tree-order.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\mathcal T,R,i,j,s,t\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}sum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeSum}_S(S,\\mathcal T)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\forall i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S\\bigl(\\mathcal T(i),\\{\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\times\\mathcal T(i)\\mid s\\subseteq t\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\nS=\\{\\langle i,t\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathcal T)\\land t\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\}\n\\land\\exists R\\;\\bigl(R=\\{\\langle\\langle i,s\\rangle,\\langle j,t\\rangle\\rangle\\in S\\times S\\mid i=j\\land s\\subseteq t\\}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(S,R)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":1568,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3780","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-sum]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","d25b709595952a78"]}